  "tip": "<p>Compute the future peak by multiplying the current peak by the <i>forecasted</i> growth factors for both rate and size, then choose the smallest configuration that meets that peak. Remember that Pub/Sub durability is built in, so focus on sizing for <i>peak</i> throughput to avoid throttling without overprovisioning.</p>",
